    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d541">

                <pb facs="0905" n="769" sameAs="frus:frus1888p1/pg769"/>

                <head>No. 541.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Sir L. S. Sackville West to Mr.
                        Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1887-09-21"><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 21,
                        1887</date>. (Received September 22.)</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to your note of the 22d of
                    June last I have the honor to inclose herewith copy of an approved minute of the
                    privy council of Canada, embodying a report of the minister of marine and
                    fisheries, dealing with the statement of Messrs. S. H. Davis &amp; Co. relative
                    to the seizure of their property by Dominion officials.</p>
                <p>I have the honor, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">L. S. Sackville
                    West.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d541-a1.xml" xpointer="d541-a1"/>
